{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10263","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得浅字 · 刘太冲","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得浅字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾师继微言，赞述在坟典。\n寸禄聊自资，平生宦情鲜。\n逶迟东州路，春草深复浅。\n日远夫子门，中心曷由展。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘太冲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}